%Now, given that $dim(C_i)<i$ 
We can conclude that \[\mathrm{dim}\left(\left\{x\in V:\mathrm{rank}\left(\frac{\partial f}{\partial \boldsymbol{X}}\right)\Big |_{\boldsymbol{x}}<m\right\}\right)\leq m-1,\]
in particular $\mathrm{Sing(V)}$ has dimension at most $m-1$.
%Which implies that $dim(sing(V(f_1,\ldots,f_m)))\leq m-1$. 

