Then we deduce that 
\begin{equation*}
    \binom{-\sqrt{q}}{k}=\frac{(-1)^k \sqrt{q}(\sqrt{q}+1)\cdots (\sqrt{q}+k-1)}{k!}.
\end{equation*}
